# PROSPECT.1 — prospect demo tenants. Tailored, prospect-NAMED demo configs (branding,
# logos, sample data, demo logins) live ONLY here and are NEVER committed — this keeps
# the SEED.1 anonymization wall intact (no real marque in the tracked repo / investor
# build). Seed via: pnpm db:seed:prospect prospects/<name>  (see docs/prospect-demo.md).
prospects/

# DEMO.6 — the demo-readiness PRD names the prospect tenants + an advisor by their real
# marques (they are the audience, and the beats are written in their language), so it
# would fail the SEED.1 wall the moment it entered specs/. It stays local, like the
# prospect configs it describes. The build blocks derived from it are marque-free.
specs/PRD-DEMO-AGENTIC.md
